le","authoredLineId":"C1_025_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Gut, dann ist die Verletzte gleich in guten Händen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_025_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, schnell — die Verletzte dort drüben braucht Hilfe!","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_025_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Ich kümmere mich sofort um sie. Ist die Verantwortliche schon informiert?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_025_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Ja, die Zuständige ist bereits unterwegs und bringt den Erste-Hilfe-Kasten mit.","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_025_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Gut, dann ist die Verletzte gleich in guten Händen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_025_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Ich kümmere mich sofort um sie. Ist die Verantwortliche schon informiert?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Timo ruft, dass die Verletzte Hilfe braucht. Reagiere.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Die Studierenden und die Teilnehmenden aus der Praxis diskutieren gemeinsam.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Timo fragt, wer heute bei der Veranstaltung dabei ist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Betroffen sind vor allem die Studierenden und die Angestellten in der Verwaltung.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Ein Journalist fragt, wen die geplante Kürzung im Institut trifft.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Die Vortragenden sind da, aber die Angemeldeten aus Wien fehlen noch.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Deine Betreuerin fragt, wer im Kolloquium noch fehlt.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Die Angemeldeten bekommen die Unterlagen, die Vortragenden kommen früher.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-25-partizipien-und-adjektive-als-nomen"